<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 hirashix0

Bundled SMAppService LaunchAgent for librescrs-prompter — a SECOND, standalone
sandboxed LaunchAgent (an inherit-sandboxed child spawned by the
agent cannot RegisterApplication; the prompter needs its own app-sandboxed
process to show the AppKit modal). The host app looks this up by
basename via AppGroupConstants.AgentService.prompterPlistName — keep the
filename and the Label in sync with that constant. BundleProgram (NOT
ProgramArguments) for the same relocatability reason as the agent's plist.
KeepAlive is the respawn mechanism (no PrompterSupervisor).
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>org.librescrs.prompter</string>
    <key>BundleProgram</key>
    <string>Contents/MacOS/librescrs-prompter</string>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>
    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <true/>
    <key>ProcessType</key>
    <string>Interactive</string>
    <key>AssociatedBundleIdentifiers</key>
    <array>
        <string>org.librescrs.LibreMac</string>
    </array>
</dict>
</plist>
